  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zYpqnrbZy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yRY2Z3l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@dariphersmods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nrx7nR1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fdaripher%252fdonate\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/byUOqSi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>將<strong>Apotheosis</strong>與<strong>Curios API</strong>模組連結，讓所有 Curios 物品都能擁有<strong>Apotheosis</strong>的詞綴與插槽功能。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Apotheosis</strong>模組能為裝備物品附加不同的詞綴，例如「+生命值」、「+傷害」等。</p><p>此系統類似於《暗黑破壞神》與《流亡黯道》等遊戲中的物品詞綴系統。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Curios API</strong>可讓您新增新的物品欄位，例如戒指、項鍊等。</p><p><br><br>然而，<strong>Apotheosis</strong>模組無法將這些新物品類型識別為裝備。</p><p><strong>Apothic Curios</strong>模組解決了這個問題，並允許模組包開發者將詞綴附加到 Curios 物品上。</p><p><br><br>Curios 的詞綴範例：<a href=\"https://github.com/Daripher/Apothic-Curios/tree/master/src/test/resources/data/apothiccurios/affixes/ring\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></p><p><br>可與 Curios 搭配的寶石範例：<a href=\"https://github.com/Daripher/Apothic-Curios/tree/master/src/test/resources/data/apotheosis/gems\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.2</a> 及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Daripher/Apothic-Curios/tree/1.20.1/src/test/resources/data/apotheosis/gems\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.1</a></p>",
